# Hosts Labyrinth may act on, with their ring group, profile and platform.
# Format: host group profile platform
#   group    : ring0 holds one low-impact canary host per platform; ring1, ring2 ... follow.
#              A host that is the only one of its kind goes in the last ring (design 01, section 6).
#   platform : ubuntu | rhel-family | windows | appliance
# Placeholder names only.

ws01     ring0   windows-member   windows
util01   ring0   linux-server     ubuntu
web01    ring1   linux-web        ubuntu
siem01   ring1   linux-siem       rhel-family
dc01     ring2   windows-dc       windows
edge01   manual  appliance        appliance
